B.Rl=new A.fU("Flutter Package - Pricing page","A pre-made pricing page component for Flutter focused on <b>fast setup of subscription and plan-selection screens<b>.\n\nWith <pricingPagePkg><b>PricingBackground<b><pricingPagePkg>, <pricingPagePkg><b>PricingPage<b><pricingPagePkg> and <pricingPagePkg><b>PricesModel<b><pricingPagePkg>, you can:\n - Define multiple pricing tiers with monthly and yearly prices\n - Get automatic loading-state handling for async CTA button actions\n - Use a responsive mobile layout with desktop side-by-side pricing cards\n - Choose between equal-height desktop cards or content-sized columns\n - Customize the decoration, typography and overall visual styling\n - Format feature strings with <babelTextPkg><sC>babel_text support<sC><babelTextPkg>\n\n<soft>It is a practical shortcut when you want a polished pricing experience quickly,<soft> while still keeping good control over the final UI.","A pre-made responsive pricing page component for Flutter with built-in async loading feedback and <b>polished plan cards<b>.\n\nIt helps you ship subscription or pricing UI quickly, including monthly and yearly billing presentation, without building the full screen from scratch.  ","art/tumbnails/packages/pricing_page.png","https://pub.dev/packages/pricing_page",A.aT8(),B.TH,375,307,B.Oc,B.iA,B.Jm,null,!1,null)
B.Rm=new A.fU("Dart Package - Enchanted Collection toolkit","A collection toolkit of useful data structures and algorithms for collections.\n\n<b>List utilities<b>\n - forEach mapper\n - mapper\n - singleWhereOrNull\n - Insert in index\n - Change element in index\n - Add value as the last element of a list\n - Split into groups\n - Detect mixed null / non-null content\n - Remove null elements from a list\n\n<b>Map utilities<b>\n - Try-cast a map with null fallback\n\n<b>Cast helpers<b>\n - Transform a list into a map\n - Transform a list into a map with a mapper\n - Transform a map into a list\n - Cast object / dynamic to a desired type","A <b>collection toolkit<b> with useful data structures and algorithms for day-to-day Dart collections.\n\n<soft>List utilities, map helpers and casting helpers in one place.<soft>  ","art/tumbnails/packages/enchanted_collection.PNG","https://pub.dev/packages/enchanted_collection",A.aT5(),B.kW,200,200,B.bR,B.aX,B.dl,null,!1,null)
B.Rn=new A.fU("Dart Package - Debouncer","A package for building debounce flows in Dart with support for <b>multiple independent debouncer instances<b>.\n\n<soft>No singleton pattern required.<soft> It helps control rapid user interactions, such as button presses or text input changes, to avoid <sC>unintended actions<sC>, unnecessary logic execution and noisy updates.","A package for building <b>debounce flows in Dart<b> with support for <sC>multiple independent debouncer instances<sC>.\n\n<soft>No singleton pattern required.<soft> It gives you a convenient way to control rapid user interactions such as button presses or text input changes.  ","art/tumbnails/packages/debouncer.PNG","https://pub.dev/packages/dart_debouncer",A.aT4(),null,200,200,B.bR,B.aX,B.dl,null,!1,null)
